From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 18:38:31 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] meshcore: speak MeshCoreKmp 0.12 and keep the radio controls
 up

Direct messages, adverts, and contact refresh use the library's real calls, and the mode chips stay available when the node has not reported a mode yet.

